        "en": "Knowledgeable and compassionate exotic specialists"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners widely commend Dr Heather Bjornebo, veterinary technicians Johnny and Ben, and the reception team for their warmth and specialist expertise. Clients describe a welcoming environment where veterinary staff explain husbandry needs thoroughly and support families through difficult decisions."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 23,
      "title": {
        "en": "Specialised handling for diverse exotics"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients bringing rabbits, reptiles, parrots, tortoises, ferrets, and backyard poultry appreciate the tailored care and gentle handling shown to each species. Reviewers highlight thoughtful touches like providing warming towels for reptiles and separate cages to reduce stress during clinical evaluations."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 10,
      "title": {
        "en": "Skilled surgical interventions and therapies"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Exotic animal owners report excellent treatment outcomes following delicate mass removals, tail amputations, parasite eradications, and emergency wound care. Multiple reviewers praise veterinarians for identifying root causes of complex symptoms rather than relying on superficial treatments."
      }
    }
