        "en": "Does the clinic perform surgeries on small exotic pets?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, clients report successful surgical procedures including mass removals, wound repairs, and tail amputations on reptiles and small mammals."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Can pet owners stay with their animals during appointments?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, clients appreciate remaining present in consultation rooms, including during sensitive procedures and compassionate farewells."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
